sequenceDiagram
    participant U as User/Agent
    participant W as CognitiveWorkspace
    participant S as SelfRegulationOrchestrator
    participant M as SelfModelStore
    participant C as CalibrationHealth
    participant H as HumilityTriggerEngine
    participant A as AttentionRouter
    participant R as RecallOrchestrator
    participant G as MetamemoryAnswerGate
    participant O as AnswerRenderer

    U->>W: Request enters active frame
    W->>S: Assess request plus workspace state
    S->>M: Load self-model, competence, failure patterns
    S->>C: Load calibration aggregates
    S->>H: Evaluate humility triggers
    S-->>S: Build SelfRegulationAssessment
    S-->>S: Select AnswerPostureDecision
    S->>A: Provide assessment and posture
    A->>R: Route recall/source audit/probe/review/abstain
    R-->>A: Recall result, trace, selected and inhibited claims
    A->>G: Request answer gate evaluation
    S->>G: Provide assessment and posture constraints
    G-->>O: Answer/warn/clarify/audit/probe/review/abstain
    O-->>U: Render output with uncertainty and next actions
